# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  Images: only the application assets are tracked
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# These three are loaded at runtime and the app degrades without them:
#   RASC_logo.jpg  — splash screen, show_splash_and_start_main()
#   the two SVGs   — Progress Graph, _CURRICULUM_SVG_FILENAMES
# Everything else in img/ is slide decks and working figures.
img/*
!img/RASC_logo.jpg
!img/2026_Aug_a - KG - Adaptive Curricula - Grad Students - 28 exercises_b.svg
!img/2026_Aug_a - KG - Adaptive Curricula - Extended - 60 exercises.svg
